<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">24022026</say-as>.</s> <s>The seventh of <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="rɑmɑˈdˤɑːn">Ramadan</phoneme>, fourteen forty-seven.</s> <s>It's morning in <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈmæk.kæ">Makkah</phoneme>, just after <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="fɑdʒr">Fajr</phoneme>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<s>Israeli settlers shot and killed a Palestinian teenager in the West Bank village of <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="mʊxˈmɑs">Mukhmas</phoneme>, wounding two others — witnesses say Israeli soldiers stood nearby, smoking, as the attack unfolded.</s> <s>Human rights groups have documented a consistent pattern in which Israeli forces protect settlers through deliberate inaction rather than intervention, and this shooting is its latest instance.</s> <s>No arrests have been made — not for this killing, and not for a separate settler assault in the same area the week before.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China stripped forty Japanese entities of access to dual-use technology exports overnight, banning sales of ships, aircraft, radar, and missile components to defence contractors including subsidiaries of <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="mɪt.suˈbi.ʃi">Mitsubishi</phoneme> Heavy Industries.</s> <s>Beijing framed the move as retaliation for Tokyo suggesting that a Chinese military attack on Taiwan could justify a Japanese military response.</s> <s>Japan's defence industry now sits at the fault line between its American alliance commitments and its dependence on Chinese markets.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Former Philippine President <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="roˈdriɡo duˈtɛrte">Rodrigo Duterte</phoneme> appeared before the International Criminal Court in The Hague, charged with crimes against humanity for ordering thousands of killings during his so-called drug war.</s> <s>Between twelve thousand and thirty thousand people died in that campaign — making <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="duˈtɛrte">Duterte</phoneme> the first Southeast Asian head of state to stand before an international criminal tribunal.</s> <s>Judges have sixty days to decide whether the case proceeds to full trial.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Panama's Supreme Court declared the twenty-nine-year concession held by Hong Kong-based CK Hutchison unconstitutional, ordering government forces to occupy both entrances to the canal.</s> <s>Washington had cited the firm's control of those terminals as evidence of Chinese influence over a waterway that handles five percent of global trade — a charge that shaped the court's ruling.</s> <s>Danish operator APM Terminals is moving in as CK Hutchison has filed for international arbitration.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel's defence minister designated five Palestinian news organizations as terrorist groups under a military order requiring no judicial review and no evidence, making it a crime to read, share, or work for any of them.</s> <s>Nearly three hundred journalists have been killed in Gaza since October twenty twenty-three; the crackdown now extends into occupied East Jerusalem and the West Bank.</s> <s>No court approved or was involved in issuing the order.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In conflict and security.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Nine hundred American troops began withdrawing from the United States' largest base in northeastern Syria, ending a partnership with the Kurdish-led Syrian Democratic Forces who lost eleven thousand fighters alongside American soldiers in the campaign to defeat the Islamic State.</s> <s>Those forces now face Turkish military pressure and a hostile new Syrian government with no external backer.</s> <s>Al-Hol camp, holding twenty-four thousand Islamic State-linked detainees, depends on fighters whose last lifeline has just been cut.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="xaˈlisko">Jalisco</phoneme> New Generation Cartel killed twenty-five Mexican soldiers overnight and erected two hundred and fifty roadblocks across twenty states — coordinated retaliation for government forces killing the cartel's founder.</s> <s>Mexico deployed two thousand five hundred additional troops to <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="xaˈlisko">Jalisco</phoneme>, but the organization was built around its founder's personal authority.</s> <s>Whether his death fractures the cartel or radicalizes it is the question Mexico's government cannot yet answer.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>FedEx filed the first major corporate lawsuit demanding full refunds of tariffs the United States Supreme Court struck down last week as exceeding presidential authority under the International Emergency Economic Powers Act.</s> <s>One hundred and seventy-five billion dollars in collected duties are now in legal limbo, and hundreds of importers are expected to follow FedEx's lead.</s> <s>The White House responded Saturday by imposing fifteen percent levies under separate legal authority, leaving the American trade system pointing in three contradictory directions at once.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Compliance investigators at the cryptocurrency exchange Binance discovered one point seven billion dollars had reached Iran through the platform between twenty twenty-four and twenty twenty-five — and were fired within weeks.</s> <s>Binance described their findings as unauthorized disclosure of client information; the transfers occurred entirely after the company's four point three billion dollar guilty plea for sanctions violations in twenty twenty-three.</s> <s>What Binance disclosed to regulators about the gap between its pledges and its conduct remains unanswered.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Fifteen people died when a Peruvian military rescue helicopter crashed in the south of the country, as El Niño Costero-driven rains triggered mudslides that buried vehicles and homes across <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌɑreˈkipa">Arequipa</phoneme> and <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈika">Ica</phoneme> provinces.</s> <s>Over seven hundred districts have declared emergencies — more than a third of all Peruvian municipalities — and forecasters warn the rains will strengthen before they ease.</s> <s>The crash grounded rescue aircraft at the moment communities needed them most.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Scientists at the Arc Institute have shown their artificial intelligence model Evo2 — trained on one hundred and twenty-eight thousand genomes — can write fully synthetic DNA sequences for organisms that have never existed.</s> <s>The same model generates toxic proteins that evade existing biosecurity screening software.</s> <s>Capacity to design synthetic life is advancing faster than any framework to govern what gets built.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>IBM — International Business Machines — posted its worst trading day since two thousand, falling thirteen point two percent, after Anthropic demonstrated that artificial intelligence can modernize COBOL systems in quarters rather than years.</s> <s>COBOL is a sixty-five-year-old programming language that still runs ninety-five percent of ATM transactions worldwide; banks and governments have long been told migration was too dangerous to attempt.</s> <s>IBM's entire legacy modernization business was built on that assumption.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Somali refugees living in Kenyan camps spent months labeling footage for what they were told was commercial artificial intelligence research — unknowingly training surveillance software for United States military drone operations.</s> <s>Australian data firm <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈæpən">Appen</phoneme> routed seventeen million dollars through layers of subcontracts specifically to conceal the Pentagon as the end client.</s> <s>Freedom of information requests to the Pentagon returned seven hundred and twenty pages — entirely redacted.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
<break time="500ms"/>
<s>We'll be back in eleven hours — just around <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="mɑɣrɪb">Maghrib</phoneme> in <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈmæk.kæ">Makkah</phoneme>, God willing.</s>
<break time="300ms"/>
<s><phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ʔɪn ʃæːʔ ɑɫ.ɫɑːh">إن شاء الله</phoneme>.</s>
</speak>